{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S08、S11、S12等短停留段纵向叠放的感受词偏密，普通观众容易来不及扫完；X的左右分栏更利于快速掠读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语把每段叙事的关键转折直接标出来，人物从舍不得、怀疑到愿意带着想念往前走的因果链更容易跟住。感受词又更常贴着具体节奏、音区、音色和音乐段落变化出现，细节比X右侧较静态的情绪词堆更可感。虽然Y在部分短段落牺牲了扫读速度，但在人物心理理解、前后连贯性和音乐感受的具体程度上，整体收益更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3c6d7605-b9ce-4e0a-9755-e6c777a1ab98", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002609462048Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:27:07.919368+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2eedbf8ee9e3114b3656b56dea2b273a152a02e9089770de5689c757e67e1700", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa2